   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Ranged Weapons</p>\n<p><em>The beloved MagRail</em><em>TM</em> <em>kit adds lightweight multipurpose magnetic rails.</em></p>\n<p>Attaching this attachment requires a DV17 Weaponstech Skill Check. Only one Magrail Kit may be installed. The weapon gains 2 Attachment Slots that can only accept Attachments that require less than 2 Slots and do not modify Capacity at all (e.g., Bipod, Sniping Scope, etc).</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The extra slots are automated, but the sheet doesn't enforce the restriction.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Rails &amp; Mounts).</em></p>"
